# Solver

- Integer Hz only — no float frequency arguments.
- `solve()` returns **fields, not register words**; encode via
  `register_file.configure(**result.fields)`.
- Bounds from `ADF435xDeviceProfile` + module constants — no `DeviceLimits`.
- MOD search scores `(abs(error_hz), mod)`; gcd-reduce when FRAC > 0.

Full rationale: [.agents/engineering_guidelines.md](../../.agents/engineering_guidelines.md)
(§6, §8), [.agents/datasheet.md](../../.agents/datasheet.md).
